# Optional. Empty means the form calls /api on the same origin.
# npm run dev proxies /api to the Functions host on port 7071.
VITE_CONTACT_API_URL=

# Optional override of the production site key in src/config/site.ts.
# Leave this as the production widget, or set the local-only test site key
# 1x00000000000000000000AA. Pair that with the always-pass test secret in
# api/local.settings.json. Never put that test secret in Azure.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAAForbSDVPuig8KiS
